# $dangerInside(pText,pOpen) -> the text inside the bracket that opens at pOpen, up to its partner.
# ( and [ nest together. Literals are masked by the caller, so no quote is counted.
# An unbalanced line returns the rest of the line.
Calculate depth as 0
For charNo from pOpen to len(pText) step 1
	Calculate oneChar as mid(pText,charNo,1)
	If oneChar='('|oneChar='['
		Calculate depth as depth+1
	Else If oneChar=')'|oneChar=']'
		Calculate depth as depth-1
		If depth=0
			Quit method mid(pText,pOpen+1,charNo-pOpen-1)
		End If
	End If
End For
Quit method mid(pText,pOpen+1)